Step 4 (Wave B): 8 price-action agents (09-16)

Tier mix: 09/10/11/12/13/15/16 = Sonnet 4.6; 14 = Opus 4.7 (CONDITIONAL veto)

agent-09 Rejection Candle (Sonnet, 500 tokens, base composite contributor)
- 8-pattern library tiered S/A/B by domain relevance for /NQ pullbacks
- 5 quality grades (textbook -> absent), score modifiers for staleness,
  volume readability, counter-macro direction, follow-through, chop cap
- Calibration nudge: textbook should be <= 1 in 5 charts

agent-10 Wick Analysis (Sonnet, 500 tokens, base composite contributor)
- 4-component scoring: ATR-relative magnitude (40 pts), wick:body (25 pts),
  direction/close-location (20 pts), cluster consistency (15 pts)
- Tier multiplier (white 1.30 / yellow 1.15 / blue 1.00) applied AFTER sum
- also_canonical_pattern flag dedupes with Agent 09 in Wave E

agent-11 Momentum Decay (Sonnet, 500 tokens)
- Pullback fatigue scorer (DISTINCT from Agent 06 trend fatigue)
- 8 ranked heuristics; soft-veto floor at score 10-29
- Multiplicative interaction with Agent 06 per Wave E spec section 5

agent-12 Volume Pattern (Sonnet, 500 tokens)
- Hard abstain when volume pane illegible
- 6 volume labels (CONFIRMING -> FALSE_BREAK_RISK)
- Session context (RTH/ETH/unknown) from chart timestamp
- Generalizes beyond pullback per scope reframe

agent-13 Bar-Level Quality (Sonnet, 500 tokens, base composite contributor)
- Crispness via 6 measurable components on last 20 bars (last 5 weighted 2x)
- Coil blind spot called out (small bodies =/= indecisive in pre-breakout)
- Sub-minute timeframe loosens doji thresholds 1.5x

agent-14 Failed-Bounce Detector (Opus, 700 tokens, CONDITIONAL VETO)
- 5-signal signature with re-entry close as dominant signal
- Need >= 2 of 5 signals before raising score above 70 (single-signal
  vetoes too aggressive)
- 4 disconfirmers cap score at 65
- variant_d_promotable flag (V1 still routes SKIP; captured for v2 calibration)
- Tilt interaction: Agent 23 confirmed_tilt suppresses promotion

agent-15 Trigger Bar Selection (Sonnet, 500 tokens)
- DEFAULT entry: break of rejection bar high/low + 1 tick (matches
  exemplars 09/10/11 annotated entries)
- Cascade-aware (Patterns A/B/C); hard rule: cascade add at WORSE
  price than original = NO_TRIGGER (revenge-trade scale-into-loss)
- Sub-minute timeframes require multi-bar confirmation

agent-16 Stop & Target Geometry (Sonnet, 500 tokens)
- R:R floor agent. Variant-specific stop conventions; 5-priority target
  hierarchy (prior swing > opposing cloud > measured move > round
  number > fixed-R)
- forces_downgrade=true on R:R < 2.0; capped at 30 below 1.0R
- Tier multipliers: T1 thresholds x1.2, T3 x0.85
- Slippage fudge 1-2 ticks conservative

Tests: 41 new tests across 8 agents (5 per agent average) covering
happy paths, all enum values, schema validation failures, abstain
handling. Verifies tier and max_tokens per agent.

208 vitest passing total (167 from Wave A + 41 new).
134 pytest still passing. TypeScript type-check clean.
